  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 632
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 你还是回去闭关修炼吧，宁州对于你还是太危险了。若是与那些“名门正派”有些纠葛，以你现在的实力恐怕难以应付。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114654942473640274}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
  fadeWhenDone: 1
  waitForClick: 1
  stopVoiceover: 1
  waitForVO: 0
  setSayDialog: {fileID: 0}
--- !u!114 &114472246669699332
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1637319367679709}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 621
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 门派？呵，门派，真是糟透了。我不会回去的。老头子当年亲自将我逐出门派，之后那些事你也知道吧，如今连面都不露就想让我回去，哈哈哈。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 114654942473640274}
  AvatarIntID: 0
  character: {fileID: 0}
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
  voiceOverClip: {fileID: 0}
  showAlways: 1
  showCount: 1
  extendPrevious: 0
